<title>UK: Visual Holdings buys U.S. audio visual firm.</title>
<headline>Visual Holdings buys U.S. audio visual firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Visual Action Holdings Plc said on Monday it had acquired Hospitality Resources Inc. a Chicago-based hotel audio visual company for 9.2 million stg.</p>
<p>Visual Holdings said the acquisition will be funded from the group's existing resources.</p>
</text>
